Draft date: 2026-10-10
Structure: act, sequence

# Act One

## The Arrival
[[id: q1]]
= Mara returns home and finds the house sold.

EXT. ALDER STREET - DAY
[[id: s1]]

A taxi pulls away. MARA (30s) stands at the curb with one bag, looking at a house with a SOLD sign in the yard.

[[beat: Mara sees the sign | id: b1]]
She reads it twice. Checks the house number.

INT. KITCHEN - DAY
[[id: s2]]

Boxes everywhere. DEAN (60s) wraps plates in newspaper. He doesn't look up.

[[beat: Mara pretends she already knew | id: b2]]
Mara sets down her bag. Smiles too quickly.

MARA
I saw the sign.

DEAN
Good. Then I don't have to say it.

[[beat: Dean gives her the key back | id: b3]]
He slides a key across the counter. Her old one, on its faded ribbon.

DEAN (CONT'D)
Found it in the drawer. Figured you'd want it.

MARA
It doesn't open anything now.

## The Buyer
[[id: q2]]
= Mara learns who bought the house.

INT. REALTOR'S OFFICE - DAY
[[id: s3]]

Mara waits across from an empty desk. A folder sits on it, her family's address on the tab.

[[beat: Mara reads the buyer's name | id: b4]]
She turns the folder around with one finger. Reads. Goes still.
